    "CVE-2026-95692": "Nginx has SSL/HTTP3 modules compiled in, but the exact reviewed startup/configuration serves HTTP port80 and proxies upstream via HTTP. No TLS/QUIC listener, TLS upstream, CMS recipient or caller-selected cipher path is configured. All native binaries, complete Nginx configuration and entrypoint scripts, empty template state, OpenSSL configuration/engine/provider directories and fixed deployment sources are bound. Reviewed excluded path: AES-GCM-SIV invalid nonce initialization."
